  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Apprentice Letter Home
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Apprentice Letter Home
  content: 'Dear Mom,


    I finally got assigned to Maintenance Crew 04!

    Nolan
    says I ask too many questions, but he still answers every one of them.

    Tessa
    keeps telling everyone I''m going to weld my boots to the floor one day.


    I
    haven''t. Yet.


    The work is harder than I imagined, but every machine feels
    like a puzzle waiting to be solved.

    I think I''m starting to understand
    why Dad loved this place.

    Don''t worry about me.


    I''ll visit once
    I finish my first full maintenance rotation.


    Love,

    Felix


    Collected
    for delivery by Owen.'
